---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Bomray Lab"
  description="Terms of Service for Bomray Lab and Needs Attention for Jira."
>
  <main class="container">
    <article class="document">
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: July 22, 2026</p>

      <p>These Terms of Service govern your use of <strong>Needs Attention for Jira</strong>, provided by Bomray Lab.</p>

      <h2>1. App purpose</h2>
      <p>The app assists Jira administrators by identifying resources that may require review. It provides evidence and recommendations but does not make administrative decisions on behalf of the user.</p>

      <h2>2. Administrator responsibility</h2>
      <p>All decisions to modify, archive, delete, or retain Jira resources remain the responsibility of the Jira administrator. Results should be reviewed before any action is taken.</p>

      <h2>3. No automatic changes</h2>
      <p>The app does not automatically delete, archive, or modify Jira resources as part of its review workflow.</p>

      <h2>4. Availability</h2>
      <p>We aim to provide a reliable service but do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation. Availability may depend on Atlassian products, APIs, Forge infrastructure, and third-party systems outside our control.</p>

      <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>You may not misuse the app, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with its operation, or use it in violation of applicable law or Atlassian's terms.</p>

      <h2>6. Intellectual property</h2>
