      <h2>7. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, Bomray Lab is not liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of the app or decisions made using its results.</p>

      <h2>8. Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms as the app evolves. Continued use after an update constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

      <h2>9. Contact</h2>
      <div class="contact-box">
        <strong>Bomray Lab</strong><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:bomray.lab@gmail.com">bomray.lab@gmail.com</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
